{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trailquest MTB</strong> is a mountain bike racing game set in a open world.\u00a0Ride on handcrafted trails, with features inspired by real-world locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/5c70b144e9a655813417c52ebf24e12f.poster.avif?t=1753274492\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/5c70b144e9a655813417c52ebf24e12f.webm?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/5c70b144e9a655813417c52ebf24e12f.mp4?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to earn medals, or beat your friends times on the trail leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/0ef55b6cf2a04cb2c0a2d877269192be.poster.avif?t=1753274492\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/0ef55b6cf2a04cb2c0a2d877269192be.webm?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/0ef55b6cf2a04cb2c0a2d877269192be.mp4?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freeride Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from racing and take on various freeride challenges to test your technical skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/42530cde446a2eb34c7b6a38f81495f3.poster.avif?t=1753274492\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/42530cde446a2eb34c7b6a38f81495f3.webm?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/42530cde446a2eb34c7b6a38f81495f3.mp4?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ride with Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy total control of the bike with no canned animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/aeaa8b058575ab052f8da734e1c0b383.poster.avif?t=1753274492\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/aeaa8b058575ab052f8da734e1c0b383.webm?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/aeaa8b058575ab052f8da734e1c0b383.mp4?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever feel lonely on the trails, invite your friends and ride together in multiplayer sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/77e705bb2403abae25cc1bb80d0881e8.poster.avif?t=1753274492\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app