ned animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/aeaa8b058575ab052f8da734e1c0b383.poster.avif?t=1753274492\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/aeaa8b058575ab052f8da734e1c0b383.webm?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/aeaa8b058575ab052f8da734e1c0b383.mp4?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever feel lonely on the trails, invite your friends and ride together in multiplayer sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/77e705bb2403abae25cc1bb80d0881e8.poster.avif?t=1753274492\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/77e705bb2403abae25cc1bb80d0881e8.webm?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/extras/77e705bb2403abae25cc1bb80d0881e8.mp4?t=1753274492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["SimfraTech"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895440/5e87b3bca41639df8d6502e35cb6e91858e8ebe5/header.jpg?t=1753274492","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requiremen